WEBVTT

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:07.742
We’ll begin with descriptive statistics such as mean and median, then look at distributions and group comparisons.

00:00:07.742 --> 00:00:13.477
Next comes correlation, followed by a simple introduction to confidence intervals.

00:00:13.477 --> 00:00:19.887
We’ll finish by matching visual forms to analytical questions and building a short statistical report.

00:00:20.476 --> 00:00:28.660
Think of the sequence as summarize, compare, relate, quantify uncertainty, and communicate.
